 <h3><u>Zameen e karbala wale</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Aye Yusuf-e-Zahra..(2)<br> Zameen-e-Karbala Walay Tujhe Awaz Daitay Hain.<br> Bahatar Be-Kafan Lashay Tujhe Awaz Daitay Hain.</p> 
  <p>Hai Kahin Ganjay-e-Shaheedan Mein Rakhi Gathri Koi.<br> Kisi Ki Lash Ke Tukray Tujhe Awaz Daitay Hain.</p> 
  <p>Chalte Naqay Se Giray Jo Maon Ki Aagosh Se.<br> Woh Sare Be-Zubaan Bache Tujhe Awaz Daitay Hain.</p> 
  <p>Tishnagi Aa Kar Sakina(SA) Our Asghar(AS) Ki Bujha.<br> Na Jane Kab Se Woh Pyase Tujhe Awaz Daitay Hain.</p> 
  <p>Al-Ajal Kehti Hain Jholay Ki Sulagti Lakriyaan.<br> Kahin Jalte Howay Khaimay Tujhe Awaz Daitay Hain.</p> 
  <p>Unn Ki Mazloomi Musaiyab Ki Zameen Se Poch Le.<br> Woh Do Bachay Ruqaiya(SA) Ke Tujhe Awaz Daitay Hain.</p> 
  <p>Jalte Khaimo Se Bacha Kar Layi Jo Sajjad(AS) Ko.<br> Ossi Ke Paon Ke Chalay Tujhe Awaz Daitay Hain.</p> 
  <p>Jo Shaheedan-e-Wilay-e-Murtaza(AS) Hai Aaj Bhi.<br> Kafan Bandhe Howay Sar Se Tujhe Awaz Daitay Hain.</p> 
